OL,3,GNEWSAHospital to replace artwork with
OL,4,Adirection signage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe planned removal of artwork from
OL,7,Fhospital corridors has disappointed an
OL,8,Fartist who says the displays bring
OL,9,Fcomfort to patients and visitors.
OL,11,FMichelle Martin, from Shinfield, said
OL,12,Fshe had been told the Royal Berkshire
OL,13,FHospital in Reading would stop
OL,14,Fexhibiting work by local artists in
OL,15,F2027.
OL,17,FShe said that the decision would make
OL,18,Fthe hospital feel more "clinical and
OL,19,Fdepressing", adding that artwork sales
OL,20,Falso raised money for its charity.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
