OL,3,GNEWSAHospital to replace artwork with
OL,4,Adirection signage
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoyal Berkshire NHS Foundation Trust
OL,7,Fsaid it wanted to improve the
OL,8,Fexperience of patients and visitors by
OL,9,Fusing the space to help people find
OL,10,Ftheir way around, but was exploring
OL,11,Falternative areas for artwork.
